We currently have a vacancy for an AI Architect , to be involved in a very important international project offering rapid career evolution. The candidate will join a software development team that uses cutting-edge technology to implement challenging IT software projects for major international public organisations. The candidate will receive adequate training and support to develop their career expectations.
What You'll Do:

• Own the end-to-end technical architecture of GenAI and LLM solutions across multiple enterprise engagements;

• Translate business and functional requirements into secure, scalable, production-ready AI architecture blueprints;

• Design advanced GenAI pipelines including RAG architectures, orchestration layers, evaluation frameworks, and model deployment strategies;

• Drive AI governance, observability, monitoring, and responsible AI practices, ensuring architectural integrity across complex client environments.

Requirements
Must-Have Qualifications:

• 3+ years of experience in AI/ML engineering or solution architecture, with a proven track record of enterprise-grade AI delivery from concept to production;

• Strong hands-on experience architecting GenAI solutions: prompt engineering strategies, RAG architectures, LLM evaluation frameworks, and production deployment patterns;

• Deep understanding of distributed systems, APIs, microservices, data architectures, and cloud-native design principles;

